<title>USA: Sharper Image Nov same-store sales fall.</title>
<headline>Sharper Image Nov same-store sales fall.</headline>
<dateline>SAN FRANCISCO 1996-12-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Percent change</p>
<p>		    1996	 1995	     Total     Same-Store</p>
<p>Month	     $23.6	$23.5	     1.0    -4.0</p>
<p>Year-to-date    $141.7     $146.9	   -4.0    -7.0</p>
<p>NOTE: Figures in millions except percentage. Same-store sales for November were $14.0 million compared to $14.7 million a year ago. Same-store sales for year-to-date were $90.3 million compared with $96.6 million a year ago.</p>
<p>    Month is	 Nov weeks ended		  N/A.</p>
<p>    Full company name is Sharper Image Corp</p>
